	\L_03d73:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes...'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'It was 1500 years ago now.'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'It was a dark age where Demon'
	R
	'Lord Gilles used monsters to'
	R
	'rule the world... Humans were'
	R
	'no more than insects.'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'We rose up to try and defeat'
	R
	'Demon Lord Gilles.'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'There was me, the mage Ho'
	R
	'Raga... Still a nice guy now,'
	R
	'but back then I was an'
	R
	'attractive, rosy-cheeked man.'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'The warrior, British...'
	R
	'My beauty... My everything...'
	R
	'I’ve never known another man'
	R
	'as wonderful as him...'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'The reason I decided to try'
	R
	'and defeat the demons is'
	R
	'because he wanted my power...'
	R
	'I had no other motive.'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'The samurai, Nikkou.'
	R
	'A brave, gallant samurai'
	R
	'woman... If she were a man,'
	R
	'she’d be just my type...'
	\L_03e98:
	{VAR0101 = 2:
		\L_03e8b:
		\L_03e45:
		!VAR0516 : 34!
		\L_03e37:
		\L_03de3:
		ZH 1:
		'Don’t say that, it’s'
		R
		'terrifying... If I was a man,'
		R
		'I would’ve stayed out of the'
		R
		'party to protect my chastity.'
		\L_03e98:
		\L_03e8b:
		\L_03e45:
		\L_03d73:
	}
	ZH 1:
	'The thief, Chaos.'
	R
	'Joining forces with such a'
	R
	'filthy man was something I’d'
	R
	'never done in my life...'
	\L_03e98:
	{VAR0101 = 1:
		\L_03e8b:
		\L_03e45:
		!VAR0516 : 80!
		\L_03e37:
		\L_03de3:
		ZH 1:
		'I-If I knew what kind of guy'
		R
		'you were, I would’ve...!'
		\L_03e98:
		ZH 1:
		'Aaaaaaaaah!! I don’t even want'
		R
		'to remember it! I sympathized'
		R
		'with the attractive men that'
		R
		'were our enemies! I...'
		\L_03e98:
		\L_03e8b:
		\L_03e45:
