		\L_03d73:
	}
	ZH 1:
	'The priestess warrior, Cafe.'
	R
	'She was short, not terribly'
	R
	'attractive, and had a loud'
	R
	'mouth... I didn’t hate her...'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'Aah... Come to think of it,'
	R
	'there is somebody somewhere'
	R
	'that has it worse than me...'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'Huhuhuhu...'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'Well... In any case, we were'
	R
	'in fact the strongest team at'
	R
	'the time. So we went off to'
	R
	'slay the Demon Lord.'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'...Or so I say, but the power'
	R
	'of humans can’t even harm'
	R
	'demons, let alone the Demon'
	R
	'Lord.'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'To do that, we needed a'
	R
	'legendary weapon...'
	R
	'So we searched. We travelled'
	R
	'around the world...'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'Then we entered the Ancient'
	R
	'Ruins, said to be the world’s'
	R
	'largest dungeon. Inside it we'
	R
	'found a giant door.'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'The door didn’t open no matter'
	R
	'what we did, however...'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'We found four gold statues in'
	R
	'the ruins, and when we placed'
	R
	'them on a pedestal in front of'
	R
	'the door it opened. We entered.'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'It was an absurd dungeon...'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'Then... Beyond the door, we'
	R
	'met a god.'
	\L_03e98:
	{VAR0101 = 1:
		\L_03e8b:
		\L_03e45:
		!VAR0516 : 80!
		\L_03e37:
		\L_03de3:
		ZH 1:
		'That was a god...?'
		R
		'Not a devil?'
		\L_03e98:
		\L_03e8b:
		\L_03e45:
		\L_03d73:
		ZH 1:
		'No... It was a god.'
		\L_03e98:
	}
	ZH 1:
	'That god said its name was'
	R
	'Planner. It praised us for'
	R
	'making it there...'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'How many humans do you think'
	R
	'there are that’ve been praised'
	R
	'by a god? We were very happy,'
	R
	'more or less ecstatic...'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'The god told us that to'
	R
	'commemorate us making it there,'
	R
	'it would grant each of us one'
	R
	'wish.'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'The wishes we chose were a'
	R
	'mistake...'
	\L_03e98:
	{VAR0101 = 1:
		\L_03e8b:
		\L_03e45:
		!VAR0516 : 80!
		\L_03e37:
		\L_03de3:
		ZH 1:
		'Yours was, at least.'
		R
		'I didn’t forget our actual'
		R
		'goal.'
		\L_03e98:
		\L_03e8b:
		\L_03e45:
		\L_03d73:
	}
	{VAR0101 = 2:
		\L_03e8b:
		\L_03e45:
		!VAR0516 : 34!
		\L_03e37:
		\L_03de3:
		ZH 1:
		'I didn’t think it was a'
		R
		'mistake... Not then...'
		\L_03e98:
		\L_03e8b:
		\L_03e45:
		\L_03d73:
	}
	ZH 1:
	'Chaos and Nikkou both spoke'
	R
	'immediately.'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'\"I wish for the power to kill'
	R
	'demons and the Demon Lord.\"'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'I wished for all knowledge.'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'Of all things, Cafe wished for'
	R
	'\"A face and body that can'
	R
	'attract any man\"...'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'The god said it would grant'
	R
	'our wishes and laughed.'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'...Yes, it laughed...'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'After that, we lost'
	R
	'consciousness.'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'The god’s power did indeed'
	R
	'give me all knowledge. I also'
	R
	'obtained immortality.'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'I knew everything.'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'But it meant nothing.'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'Having things you don’t know'
	R
	'is what makes life fun. Thirst'
	R
	'for knowledge... I lived to'
	R
	'have curiosity and dreams...'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'But after I knew everything,'
	R
	'there was nothing new to drive'
	R
	'me...'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'The moment I knew everything,'
	R
	'I was interested in nothing...'
	R
	'Not even the demons or the'
	R
	'Demon Lord...'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'Everything about the world,'
	R
	'and how everything interacts...'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'I already knew...'
	R
	'everything...'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'From one corner of this world'
	R
	'to the other...'
	\L_03e98:
	ZH 1:
	'In that instant, I lost all'
	R
	'the willpower I had.'
	\L_03e98:
