		ZH 1:
		'Even though he could’ve died'
		R
		'being left there like that...'
		\L_03e98:
		ZH 1:
		'He made that decision and'
		R
		'stayed behind so not to hold'
		R
		'us back...'
		\L_03e98:
		ZH 1:
		'When I think about it...'
		R
		'It hurts my heart even now...'
		\L_03e98:
		ZH 1:
		'I wonder whether I should have'
		R
		'used magic there...'
		\L_03e98:
		ZH 1:
		'Aah... He also said he thought'
		R
		'that if anything happened to'
		R
		'the gold statues, we’d be in'
		R
		'danger...'
		\L_03e98:
		ZH 1:
		'I think he stayed back to look'
